&#x02013;2.5</td><td align="left">1.6&#x02013;2.9/1.5&#x02013;2.3</td><td align="left">2.1&#x02013;2.4/2.0&#x02013;2.4</td><td align="left">1.49&#x02013;2.4/1.44&#x02013;2.4</td></tr><tr><td align="left">E to E' ratio</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Mean</td><td align="left">27.8/26.2</td><td align="left">25.4/25.8</td><td align="left">26.3/25.9</td><td align="left">30.1/26.2</td><td align="left">27.7/25.0</td><td align="left">27.3/26.5</td><td align="left">27.6/27.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;SD</td><td align="left">3.7/3.8</td><td align="left">1.17/1.29</td><td align="left">2.25/3.99</td><td align="left">6.18/3.33</td><td align="left">2.2/3.3</td><td align="left">3.0/4.5</td><td align="left">3.5/4.7</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Range</td><td align="left">21.2 &#x02013; 37.7/20.6&#x02013;35.4</td><td align="left">24.1&#x02013;26.9/24.0&#x02013;27.1</td><td align="left">24.4&#x02013;30.0/20.6&#x02013;30.4</td><td align="left">21.2&#x02013;37.7/20.9 &#x02013; 29.3</td><td align="left">26.3&#x02013;31.8/21.1&#x02013;30.4</td><td align="left">23 &#x02013; 30.8/22.3&#x02013;34.2</td><td align="left">23.4&#x02013;34.2/22.9&#x02013;35.4</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>Group 1&#x02013;6 (see Table 1)</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T3"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Radial and circumferential 2D strain</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td></td><td align="left">Group 2&#x02013;6 <italic>Before/after therapy</italic></td><td align="left">Group 1</td><td align="left">Group 2</td><td align="left">Group 3</td><td align="left">Group 4</td><td align="left">Group 5</td><td align="left">Group 6</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><underline><italic>Radial </italic>Strain</underline></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">Anterior Strain-%</td><td></td>